1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,500
Aegis Pulse: pulse and breathing from a webcam,
using the Presage SmartSpectra SDK

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,000
Camera is off. Nothing runs until you consent.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:14,500
Your API key lives in the macOS Keychain
and is never shown in the app

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Video stays on this Mac. The SDK sends derived measurements
(pulse, breathing) and session metadata to Presage. Telemetry is off.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:31,000
Consent is explicit, asked on every launch,
and enforced in the app's main process

6
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:41,500
Start is a separate step. Only now does the camera open.
(Camera preview hidden for privacy.)

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:50,500
Readiness shows what the SDK still needs:
stay still and face the camera

8
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:59,500
Values are the SDK's own, with its confidence
and a steady / still-settling flag. Nothing is filled in.

9
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:14,000
Signal Lab: the SDK's relative waveforms, plotted as received.
Shape only, not blood pressure.

10
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:24,500
Sessions: counts from this session only.
Kept in memory, discarded when you quit.

11
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:34,500
Diagnostics: live frame rate, IPC latency and dropped-frame counters

12
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:44,000
Switching views never restarts the camera or the SDK session

13
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:54,000
Stop & release camera: one click, from any view.
Back to IDLE, camera off.

14
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Wellness information only. Not a medical device. Not clinically validated.
Measurements are sent to Presage.
